  "title": "Zuppa di Pesce e Frutti di Mare (Mediterranean Seafood Soup)",
  "description": "Frutti di mare (seafood) like fish, prawns, clams, and mussels are simmered with vegetables in a homemade fish stock for this authentic Mediterranean soup.",
  "authors": [
    "Giulia"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:08:43-04:00",
